    about: {
      title: 'About SkinGuard AI',
      subtitle: 'Skin self-monitoring, made simple.',
      missionTitle: 'Our Mission',
      missionText: 'SkinGuard AI was built with a single purpose: to make skin self-monitoring simple enough that people actually keep doing it. Dermatologists advise looking at your own skin regularly and having anything that changes checked by a professional — but changes are hard to spot from memory. SkinGuard AI keeps a dated photo record for you and reminds you to look again. It does not replace a dermatologist, and it does not tell you whether a lesion is cancerous.',
      howItWorksTitle: 'How It Works',
      howItWorksText: 'SkinGuard AI compares your photo against the ABCDE criteria (Asymmetry, Border, Colour, Diameter, Evolution) that dermatologists teach for skin self-examination. Take a photo of a mole and the app stores it with a date, describes what it sees against those five markers, and highlights differences between photos so you can raise them with a dermatologist. It produces an informational description, not a finding.',
      whyMattersTitle: 'Why It Matters',
      stat1: 'For melanoma found at the localized stage, the 5-year relative survival rate in the US is about 99% (American Cancer Society / SEER).',
      stat2: 'About 330,000 new melanoma cases were recorded worldwide in 2022 (WHO / IARC, GLOBOCAN).',
      stat3: 'Dermatology guidance encourages regular skin self-examination between professional check-ups.',
      disclaimerTitle: 'Medical Disclaimer',
      disclaimerText: 'SkinGuard AI is a monitoring and tracking tool — not a medical diagnostic device. It does not replace professional dermatological evaluation. Always consult a qualified dermatologist for any skin concerns.',
      teamTitle: 'Built for Everyone',
      teamText: "SkinGuard AI is built and operated by Visa Line Inc., a small independent team, with the aim of making skin self-monitoring simple and affordable. It is available on iOS, Android and the web, so you can keep track of your skin anywhere.",
      ctaTitle: 'Start Monitoring Today',
      ctaText: 'Take control of your skin health with AI-assisted tracking.',
      ctaBtn: 'Get Started Free',
    },
